  "name": "Marine Mammals Skull Database",
  "description": "The Marine Mammal Skull Database contains skull images of 51 species of marine mammals with complete or almost complete skull specimen. Click on the Marine Mammal Systematics link to search for skull images in the database.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To share images of skull specimens of the marine mammals species of the world archived at the National Science Museum, Tokyo.",
